# Coveted Jewel is cast for six off a Black Lotus and a Sol Ring, draws three as it enters, and is tapped for three
# green. A Gorilla then gets through unblocked, and the Jewel's trigger (CR 509.1h) hands it across the table: three
# cards for the attacker, the artifact under their control (CR 108.4), untapped again.
#
# Handed over in the combat damage step with the Jewel already on the other side of the table, so the board can be
# pictured the moment after a permanent has changed hands.

